{"text":{"en":{"서울 구로구 경인로53길 32, 미래에코타워 B101·102호":"B101–102, Mirae Eco Tower, 32 Gyeongin-ro 53-gil, Guro-gu, Seoul","<p class=\"eyebrow\">U-Packing GLY Type</p> <h2>U패킹 GLY형</h2> <p>피스톤·로드 겸용으로 사용하는 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">U-패킹 GLY형</strong>입니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">U-Packing GLY Type</p> <h2>U-Packing GLY Type</h2> <p>A <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">U-Packing GLY type</strong> used for both piston and rod applications.</p>","U패킹 GLY형":"U-Packing GLY Type","U패킹 KY형":"U-Packing KY Type","U패킹 SKY형":"U-Packing SKY Type","<img class=\"fig-draw\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/u_packing_gly_diagram.webp?v=wm5\" alt=\"U-Packing GLY형 도면\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 단면도<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=안지름 · D=바깥지름 · H=패킹 전체 높이(축 방향 길이, 립 끝 포함)</span></p>":"<img class=\"fig-draw\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/u_packing_gly_diagram.webp?v=wm5\" alt=\"U-Packing GLY Type Drawing\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ Cross-section<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d = inner dia. · D = outer dia. · H = overall packing height (axial length incl. lip tip)</span></p>"},"ja":{"서울 구로구 경인로53길 32, 미래에코타워 B101·102호":"ソウル特別市九老区京仁路53ギル32 未来エコタワー B101・102号","<p class=\"eyebrow\">U-Packing GLY Type</p> <h2>U패킹 GLY형</h2> <p>피스톤·로드 겸용으로 사용하는 <strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">U-패킹 GLY형</strong>입니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">U-Packing GLY Type</p> <h2>UパッキンGLY型</h2> <p>ピストン・ロッド兼用で使用する<strong style=\"color: var(--accent);\">UパッキンGLY型</strong>です。</p>","U패킹 GLY형":"Uパッキン GLY型","U패킹 KY형":"Uパッキン KY形","U패킹 SKY형":"Uパッキン SKY形","<img class=\"fig-draw\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/u_packing_gly_diagram.webp?v=wm5\" alt=\"U-Packing GLY형 도면\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 단면도<br><span style=\"color: var(--text-faint);\">d=안지름 · D=바깥지름 · H=패킹 전체 높이(축 방향 길이, 립 끝 포함)</span></p>":"<img class=\"fig-draw\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/u_packing_gly_diagram.webp?v=wm5\" alt=\"UパッキンGLY型図面\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">↑ 断面図<br><span style=\"colo